title: "shirik_RCD_analysis: CellposeSAM RCD and Mtb infection analysis pipeline"
abstract: >-
  CellposeSAM-mediated brightfield cell segmentation and intensity/morphology
  feature extraction for RCD (single-cell) analysis on ND2 images, with an
  infection pipeline for Mycobacterium (Mtb) segmentation, per-cell infection
  status, bacterial load, batch processing, and plate-level visualization.
